11
00:00:36,301 --> 00:00:38,051
(Past Sheldon:)In that case, I don't need my jacket.

12
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,220
(Past Sheldon:)And for the record,
the correct syntax is:

13
00:00:41,389 --> 00:00:44,429
"I'm the guy from whom
you're trying to get away."

14
00:00:53,318 --> 00:00:55,108
(Past Sheldon:)Oh, yes.

15
00:00:58,531 --> 00:01:02,021
This is definitely gonna be my spot.

